<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millennium Chemicals.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millennium Chemicals.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of Millennium Chemicals, the planned spinoff of Hanson Plc that will start trading on the NYSE on October 1, with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Gary Schneider confirmed he started coverage of the stock and set share earnings estimate of $2.20 for this year and $2.65 for 1997.</p>
</text>
